ment","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"Sometimes, it's we can raise prices and sometimes it's we're going to be lower to be more competitive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2019 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"The good news is that we continue to focus on cost-reduction initiatives, which we believe will have a continuing benefit throughout the remainder of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2019 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"The benefit from various ongoing cost-reduction initiatives helped to offset the decline in high margin trust fund revenue and prevent additional growth in fixed costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2019 Q3","e":"sci","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hultberg","x":"Funeral margin, can you provide some perspective on that, as well, as we look ahead and maybe elaborate a little bit on the cost-saving initiatives and how that could impact the longer-term funeral margin profile?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/service-corporation-international-sci-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2019 Q4","e":"sci","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Ransom","x":"And just kind of curious, I know it's complicated, but do you think that form will follow a function here in terms of, say, well, maybe we don't need 197 blue urns, maybe we can simplify what we're offering and use Beacon as an excuse to streamline some of the complexity in the cemetery line?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/service-corporation-international-sci-q4-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2020 Q1","e":"sci","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"But for the most part, the cost-saving initiatives should begin to show up in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2020 Q1","e":"sci","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"I mean, all of these are really kind of -- the way to think about it, we have not, to date, had any layoffs or anything of the sorts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2020 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"We implemented a number of temporary cost-saving initiatives and quickly introduced additional technology to support our operations, sales efforts and administrative functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2020 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"A.J. Rice","x":"Now I know there was a lot of company-specific initiatives as well that were designed to pull cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SCI 2020 Q3","e":"sci","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Debbie Young","x":"So with that out of the way, let me pass it on to our chairman and CEO, Tom Ryan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/service-corporation-international-sci-q3-2020-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2020 Q4","e":"sci","d":"2021-02-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"Virtual arrangements, live streaming of services, outdoor services, drive-through visitations, radio transmitted graveside services, and many more unique memorialization and celebration of life ideas are 