ment","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"And I think as we go forward, we feel very good about our ability to pass-through inflationary pricing and expand the menu of products and services as it relates to that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q1","e":"sci","d":"2021-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"However, based upon our preneed cemetery sales production for the first four months of the year, we are increasing our guidance for the year from a decline in the mid-single digits, to finish the year in a range of flat to potentially low single-digit percentage growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q1","e":"sci","d":"2021-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Tanzberger","x":"I am pleased that we're able to increase our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"Based upon results in the first half, we're again raising our guidance range to $3.20 to $3.50.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q3","e":"sci","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Debbie Young","x":"With that out of the way, I'll now pass it on to Tom Ryan, our chairman and CEO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/service-corporation-international-sci-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q3","e":"sci","d":"2021-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"Based upon better-than-expected results in the third quarter, we are again raising our guidance to an earnings per share range of $4.15 to $4.45 for the full year 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/service-corporation-international-sci-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q4","e":"sci","d":"2022-02-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Debbie Young","x":"With that out of the way, I'll now pass it on to our chairman and CEO, Tom Ryan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/15/service-corporation-international-sci-q4-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2021 Q4","e":"sci","d":"2022-02-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"And so you think about the 8%, it's not necessarily a price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/15/service-corporation-international-sci-q4-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2022 Q1","e":"sci","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Debbie Young","x":"With that behind us, I'll now pass it on to our chairman and CEO, Tom Ryan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2022-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2022 Q1","e":"sci","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ryan","x":"And if inflation is a little higher in that, then we'll probably experience a little higher price increases too.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/service-corporation-international-sci-q1-2022-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2022 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Tanzberger","x":"We remain very comfortable and we reiterate our annual guidance for adjusted operating cash flow of $750 million to $800 million, again for the full year of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/service-corporation-international-sci-q2-2022-earn/"},{"c":"SCI 2022 Q2","e":"sci","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Tanzberger","x":"Included in this confirmed guidance is a slight adjustment to our previous cash tax payment estimate of $180 million to now be in the range of $180 million to $190 mil